     "economic activity",
     "non-economic activity",
     "volunteer"
    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "Economic activities are work done to earn money, such as farming, teaching, driving and selling. Non-economic activities are done out of love or duty without pay, like cooking for the family or helping neighbours.\nNon-economic work is just as important because it supports families and communities.\nCommunity participation, such as cleaning the street together, shows the value of work for everyone."
    }
